<p>You temporarily overcharge the saw motors, increasing the effective talent level of all saw talents by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">24%, 28%, 30%, 32%, 34%</acronym> for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">The pain shall never stop!</span></span></p>